<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Elan Corp opens new R&amp;D facility in Athlone.</title>
<headline>Elan Corp opens new R&amp;D facility in Athlone.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Elan Corporation Plc said on Monday that it had opened a new research and development facility at its Athlone campus in Ireland.</p>
<p>The new facility, which doubles the capacity for product development at Athlone, represents a total capital spend of $15 million by Elan Pharmaceutical Technologies on pre-formulation and process scale-up over the past four years, Elan said in a statement.</p>
<p>The new facility will employ 90 graduates when fully operational and will cater for more than 30 projects covering such areas as pain management, blood pressure control, arthritis and epilepsy drugs.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
